            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Hut",
            "review_text": "oldsalt55\nCastlegar, Canada48 contributions\n0\nIt's a Pizza Hut\nMar 2016 • Friends\nOkay, this is a Pizza Hut, they're the same all over. Here your choices are a little different but you can still order any of their different crusts and so on. One day I went in to order a pizza or two and have them delivered to an address an hour and a half later. I thought it was going to be impossible to get my point across to the people there, language barrier and all, but she got it right away and my delivery came as expected, at the right time and the order was correct. I stood outside the restaurant for a while waiting for a friend and the girl must have thought I was waiting for the pizza so she came out to double check that everything was right. There's a good employee. Being a Pizza Hut, their prices are a bit high but they do maintain a certain quality. Thumbs up.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 20, 2016",
